### Solution:
```java
@Override
@WorkerThread
protected List<AppListModel> doInBackground(Void... voids) {
    ArrayList<AppListModel> models = new ArrayList<>();

    // Retrieve the list of installed applications
    PackageManager packageManager = mContext.getPackageManager();
    List<ApplicationInfo> installedApplications = packageManager.getInstalledApplications(0);

    // Create AppListModel objects for each installed application
    for (ApplicationInfo appInfo : installedApplications) {
        // Create an AppListModel object with the application name and package name
        AppListModel appModel = new AppListModel();
