You are tasked with implementing a method to render a checkbox as checked or unchecked based on the value of a property in a model object. The method should take an object representing the model and the name of the property to be checked. The model object has a method `Reflection()` that provides reflection capabilities, and the `GetPropertyValue` method retrieves the value of a specified property.

