library.display_available_books()
library.borrow_book("Alice", "Clean Code")
library.borrow_book("Bob", "Python Crash Course")
library.borrow_book("Alice", "Python Crash Course")  # Attempt to borrow the same book again
library.return_book("Bob", "Python Crash Course")
library.display_available_books()
```

The `Library` class is implemented with the specified methods to manage the borrowing and returning of books. The example usage demonstrates the functionality of the class, including displaying available books, borrowing books, and returning books.

