- If `operator` is `ComparisonOperator.Equal`, return processes where at least one messaging step has a status equal to `messagingStatus` or at least one processing step has a status equal to `processingStatus`.
- If `operator` is `ComparisonOperator.NotEqual`, return processes where all messaging steps have a status not equal to `messagingStatus` and all processing steps have a status not equal to `processingStatus`.

Assume the following enum and class definitions:
```csharp
public enum Status
