You are provided with the following Rust code snippet that defines the structures for shaped and shapeless recipes:

```rust
#[derive(Debug, Serialize, Deserialize)]
pub struct ShapedRecipe {
    result: RecipeItem,  // The item produced by the recipe
    #[serde(rename = "inShape")]
    in_shape: Shape,     // The required shape of the ingredients on the crafting grid
    #[serde(rename = "outShape")]
